        "x1": 0.43899836601307185,
        "y1": 0.6868686868686869
      },
      "text": "My last five years as a member of OPCC have been very enjoyable and rewarding.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.1437908496732026,
        "y0": 0.6856060606060606,
        "x1": 0.4553382352941176,
        "y1": 0.7563131313131313
      },
      "text": "I have met many talented people and have made many friends, and have learned more about photography than I had hoped for.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
      "block_type": "text",
      "box": {
        "page": 0,
        "x0": 0.5261437908496732,
        "y0": 0.5046300505050505,
        "x1": 0.8382352941176471,
        "y1": 0.5972222222222222
      },
      "text": "The travel bug is still with me having traveled to Europe, Africa, South America and Antarctica since we last met and with a few weeks in Southeast Asia scheduled for February.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
      "section_hierarchy": []
    },
    {
