        "x0": 0.5263954248366013,
        "y0": 0.6123737373737373,
        "x1": 0.8469493464052287,
        "y1": 0.6982323232323233
      },
      "text": "I will send Jim my email address once I get settled so we can keep in contact. Thanks again for the friendships and I wish all of you a Great Christmas and all the best in the New Year.",
      "html": null,
      "level": null,
